<p class="mb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Bighorn Threads coordinates apparel programs for Vegas HVAC service shops. Selected production partners handle approved decoration. Your quote confirms exact products, availability, commercial terms, and timing.</p>
 <a href="/industries/plumbing-hvac-las-vegas/" class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 bg-gold-500 px-7 py-3 text-base font-bold text-charcoal transition-all hover:bg-gold-600">See HVAC Apparel →</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </article>
</BaseLayout>
